<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brown Bros starts Agouron.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brown Bros starts Agouron.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Brown Brothers Harriman analyst Robert LeBoyer said he initiated coverage of Agouron Pharmaceuticals Inc with a near-term hold rating and a long-term outperform.</p>
<p>-- He set a 12-month $95 price target on the stock, which was off 1-7/8 at 81-7/8.</p>
</text>
